This repository contains files derived from two works under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE):

  - iris-3b, Copyright 2026 Speridlabs
    model: https://huggingface.co/speridlabs/iris-3b (revision adc05b909fb05d4276d26aae5a52b36406b2ef26, turbo/)
